Gold (blue, RS) v. inverted US real rates (TIP ETF, red, LS).

There's nothing more bullish for gold than rising real rates in a nation that is...

-in fiscal dominance;

-with debt/GDP >120% & deficit/GDP at 6% (& moving higher);

...b/c rising reals accelerates a debt spiral.

